Here’s a basic HTML button example:

```html
<button type="button">Click Me</button>
```

With simple CSS styling:

```html
<button class="my-button">Click Me</button>

<style>
  .my-button {
    background-color: #007bff;
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    cursor: pointer;
    font-size: 16px;
  }

  .my-button:hover {
    background-color: #0056b3;
  }
</style>
```

